---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import { firmware } from "../firmware.js";

const steps = ["安装前确认", "连接并写入", "放入书和字体", "开始阅读"];
---
<Site title="安装固件 · Pico Page" description="在电脑版 Chrome 或 Edge 中，用 USB 线把 Pico Page 安装到 Read Pico，再放入书和字体。" current="install">
  <!-- TODO: 手动安装方法确定后恢复设计稿中的「完整安装文档与手动安装方法」链接。 -->
        <section class="intro">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">安装固件</p>
            <h1>把 Read Pico，<br>变成 Pico Page。</h1>
          </div>
          <ul class="needs">
            <li><span>设备</span><span>Read Pico 4.7″</span></li>
            <li><span>数据线</span><span>支持数据传输的 USB 线</span></li>
            <li><span>浏览器</span><span>电脑版 Chrome 或 Edge</span></li>
            <li><span>TF 卡</span><span>FAT 文件系统</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <ol class="tracker" aria-label="安装步骤">
          {steps.map((title, index) => (
            <li class={index < 1 ? "past" : undefined} aria-current={index === 1 ? "step" : undefined}><span>0{index + 1}</span><strong>{title}</strong></li>
          ))}
        </ol>
        <div class="layout">
          <div class="steps">
            <article class="step">
              <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
              <div>
                <h2>安装前确认</h2>
                <ul class="checks">
                  <li><span aria-hidden="true">☐</span><span>写入会替换设备上现有的阅读程序。需要回到官方系统时，请先阅读<a href="https://dot.mindreset.tech/docs/read_0/firmware" target="_blank" rel="noopener">官方的构建与烧录说明</a>：目前需要用 ESP-IDF 从源码构建后烧录。</span></li>
                  <li><span aria-hidden="true">☐</span><span>安装会<strong>整片覆盖</strong>设备闪存，包括 bootloader 和分区表。无论设备上现在是原厂系统还是其他固件，都可以直接安装。TF 卡不受影响。</span></li>
                  <li><span aria-hidden="true">☐</span><span>设备电量充足，或保持 USB 供电。</span></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="step">
              <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
              <div>
                <h2>连接设备并写入</h2>
                <p>用 USB 线连接电脑，点击「连接设备」，在浏览器弹窗里选择 Read Pico 的串口。写入期间请保持页面打开、电脑唤醒、数据线不动。</p>
                <div class="flash" data-phase={firmware ? "idle" : "unreleased"} data-url={firmware?.url} data-sha256={firmware?.sha256}>
                  <div class="flash-head">
                    <span class="flash-status" aria-live="polite"><span class="dot"></span><span data-el="status">{firmware ? "未连接" : "尚未发布"}</span></span>
                    {firmware && <span class="mono">Pico Page {firmware.version}</span>}
                  </div>
                  {firmware ? (
                    <div class="flash-body">
                      <p class="notice" data-el="error" role="alert" hidden></p>
                      <div data-panel="idle">
                        <p data-el="hint">尚未连接。弹窗里没有设备时，换一根数据线或 USB 接口再试。</p>
                        <button class="primary" type="button" data-el="connect">连接设备</button>
                      </div>
                      <div data-panel="connected" hidden>
                        <dl>
                          <div><dt>芯片</dt><dd>ESP32-S3 · 16 MiB 闪存</dd></div>
                          <div><dt>方式</dt><dd>整片覆盖写入</dd></div>
                        </dl>
                        <p class="notice">设备闪存中的所有内容都会被清除，包括现有固件和设备内保存的 Wi‑Fi 等设置。回到官方系统的方法见第 1 步中的官方说明。</p>
                        <label class="confirm"><input type="checkbox" data-el="confirm"><span>我确认连接的是 Read Pico。本页只能核对芯片型号和闪存容量；连接的是其他设备时，它的全部内容同样会被清除。</span></label>
                        <div class="choices">
                          <button class="primary" type="button" data-el="install" disabled>安装 Pico Page</button>
                          <button class="secondary" type="button" data-el="disconnect">断开</button>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div data-panel="writing" hidden>
                        <div class="progress-line"><span data-el="stage"></span><span class="mono" data-el="percent"></span></div>
                        <div class="track" role="progressbar" aria-label="安装进度" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"><div data-el="bar"></div></div>
                        <p class="keep">请勿拔线或关闭页面。</p>
                      </div>
                      <div data-panel="done" hidden>
                        <p class="finished">安装完成。</p>
                        <p class="after">设备会自动重启并显示书库。屏幕没有变化时，长按电源键，在菜单中选择「重启」。</p>
                        <div class="choices"><a class="primary" href="#step3">下一步：放入书和字体 ↓</a></div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  ) : (
                    <div class="flash-body">
                      <div>
                        <p>固件尚未发布。项目仍在开发中，发布后这里会开放安装。</p>
                        <button class="primary" type="button" disabled>连接设备</button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="step3" class="step">
              <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
              <div>
                <h2>放入书和字体</h2>
                <p>把 TF 卡接到电脑，或在设备上开启 USB 文件传输，按下面的结构放好文件。</p>
                <div class="tree">
                  <div class="muted">TF 卡/</div>
                  <div><span>├─ <strong>Books/</strong></span><span>EPUB、TXT</span></div>
                  <div><span>├─ <strong class="accent">Fonts/</strong></span><span class="accent">中文字体，强烈建议</span></div>
                  <div><span>└─ LockScreens/</span><span class="muted">锁屏图片，可选</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="font-note">
                  <p>内置字体只有 3,500 个常用汉字，其余字符显示为方框。推荐霞鹜文楷，按 SIL OFL 1.1 免费分发。</p>
                  <a href="/downloads/LXGWWenKai-Regular-v1.520.zip" download>下载霞鹜文楷 ↓</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="step">
              <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
              <div>
                <h2>打开书，选字体</h2>
                <p>TF 卡插回设备后重启（长按电源键，选「重启」）。在书库打开一本书，轻点正文中部 → 「排版」 → 选择放入的字体。按 K1、K3 翻页，有残影时按 K2 全刷。短按电源键休眠。离线说明在「设置 → 使用说明」。</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
          <aside>
            <div>
              <h3>已经在用 Pico Page？</h3>
              <p>连接 Wi‑Fi 后可在设备上联网更新。也可以在这个页面重新安装。书、进度和设置保存在 TF 卡上，不受影响。</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>遇到问题</h3>
              <details>
                <summary>弹窗里没有设备</summary>
                <p>确认数据线支持数据传输，换一个 USB 接口；关闭占用串口的其他程序和浏览器标签。</p>
              </details>
              <details>
                <summary>装过其他固件，还能装吗</summary>
                <p>可以。安装会整片覆盖，替换原有的 bootloader 和分区表，不需要先刷回原厂系统。</p>
              </details>
              <details>
                <summary>写入中断</summary>
                <p>保持供电，重新连接并安装一次。</p>
              </details>
              <details>
                <summary>安装完成，屏幕没变化</summary>
                <p>墨水屏断电后会保留旧画面。重新上电后再看；仍无变化时，重新连接并安装一次。</p>
              </details>
              <details>
                <summary>书里有空白方框</summary>
                <p>这是内置字体缺字。把完整中文字体放进 <code>Fonts/</code>，并在「排版」中选择它。</p>
              </details>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
  <script>
      // Installs the full-flash image over Web Serial. The serial protocol comes from esptool-js,
      // fetched when the visitor connects.
      const card = document.querySelector(".flash[data-url]");
      if (card) {
        const { url, sha256 } = card.dataset;
        const el = (name) => card.querySelector(`[data-el="${name}"]`);
        const steps = document.querySelectorAll(".tracker li");
        const labels = { idle: "未连接", connected: "已连接", writing: "正在安装", done: "已完成" };
        let transport, loader, md5;

        function show(phase, error = "") {
          card.dataset.phase = phase;
          el("status").textContent = labels[phase];
          el("error").textContent = error;
          el("error").hidden = !error;
          el("confirm").checked = false;
          el("install").disabled = true;
          card.querySelectorAll("[data-panel]").forEach((panel) => (panel.hidden = panel.dataset.panel !== phase));
          const current = phase === "done" ? 2 : 1;
          steps.forEach((step, index) => {
            step.classList.toggle("past", index < current);
            if (index === current) step.setAttribute("aria-current", "step");
            else step.removeAttribute("aria-current");
          });
        }

        function progress(percent, stage) {
          el("stage").textContent = stage;
          el("percent").textContent = `${percent}%`;
          el("bar").style.width = `${percent}%`;
          el("bar").parentElement.setAttribute("aria-valuenow", percent);
        }

        // Restarts the device out of download mode and frees the port. Returns whether both
        // succeeded; a page reload frees a port that did not close.
        async function release() {
          let clean = true;
          await loader?.after("hard_reset").catch(() => (clean = false));
          await transport?.disconnect().catch(() => (clean = false));
          transport = loader = undefined;
          return clean;
        }

        async function connect() {
          let port;
          try {
            port = await navigator.serial.requestPort({ filters: [{ usbVendorId: 0x303a }] });
          } catch {
            return; // The visitor closed the chooser.
          }
          const button = el("connect");
          button.disabled = true;
          button.textContent = "正在连接…";
          try {
            const [{ ESPLoader, Transport }, { default: SparkMD5 }] = await Promise.all([import("esptool-js"), import("spark-md5")]);
            md5 = (image) => SparkMD5.ArrayBuffer.hash(image.slice().buffer);
            transport = new Transport(port, false);
            loader = new ESPLoader({ transport, baudrate: 115200 });
            await loader.main();
            // Only the stub that main() loads can erase the whole chip; without it the old boot
            // data would survive the installation.
            if (!loader.IS_STUB) throw new Error("The flasher stub is not running");
            let refusal = "";
            // Read Pico is an ESP32-S3 with 16 MiB of flash. Other boards match this too, so the
            // visitor confirms the device before installing.
            if (loader.chip.CHIP_NAME !== "ESP32-S3" || (await loader.detectFlashSize()) !== "16MB") {
              refusal = "连接的设备不是 Read Pico，没有写入任何内容。";
            } else {
              // Read from the ROM during chip detection. The image is plaintext and unsigned: it
              // would not start on a chip with flash encryption (an odd number of counter bits
              // set) or secure boot.
              const security = await loader.getSecurityInfo();
              const encrypted = security.flashCryptCnt.toString(2).replaceAll("0", "").length % 2 === 1;
              if (encrypted || security.parsedFlags.SECURE_BOOT_EN) {
                refusal = "这台设备启用了闪存加密或安全启动，本页写入的固件无法在它上面启动。没有写入任何内容。";
              }
            }
            if (refusal) {
              await release();
              show("idle", refusal);
            } else {
              show("connected");
            }
          } catch (error) {
            console.error(error);
            await release();
            show("idle", "没有连上设备。关闭占用串口的其他程序和浏览器标签，重新插拔数据线后再试。");
          } finally {
            button.disabled = false;
            button.textContent = "连接设备";
          }
        }

        async function install() {
          show("writing");
          progress(0, "正在下载固件");
          let erasing = false;
          try {
            const response = await fetch(url);
            if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);
            const image = new Uint8Array(await response.arrayBuffer());
            const digest = new Uint8Array(await crypto.subtle.digest("SHA-256", image));
            if (Array.from(digest, (byte) => byte.toString(16).padStart(2, "0")).join("") !== sha256) {
              throw new Error("The downloaded image does not match the published digest");
            }
            erasing = true;
            progress(0, "正在擦除整片闪存");
            await loader.writeFlash({
              fileArray: [{ data: image, address: 0 }],
              flashMode: "keep",
              flashFreq: "keep",
              flashSize: "keep",
              eraseAll: true,
              compress: true,
              calculateMD5Hash: md5,
              reportProgress: (_, written, total) =>
                progress(Math.floor((written / total) * 100), written < total ? "正在写入" : "正在校验"),
            });
            show("done", (await release()) ? "" : "固件已写入并通过校验，但设备可能没有自动重启。请手动重启设备。");
          } catch (error) {
            console.error(error);
            await release();
            show("idle", erasing ? "安装没有完成。保持供电，重新连接后再安装一次。" : "固件下载失败，设备没有改动。检查网络后重新连接再试。");
          }
        }

        el("connect").addEventListener("click", connect);
        el("install").addEventListener("click", install);
        el("confirm").addEventListener("change", () => (el("install").disabled = !el("confirm").checked));
        el("disconnect").addEventListener("click", async () => {
          show("idle", (await release()) ? "" : "串口没有正常释放，设备可能仍在下载模式。请手动重启设备；无法再次连接时，刷新本页。");
        });
        // A connected device runs the flasher stub until it is reset, and closing the page cannot
        // reset it. The browser asks before leaving while connected or writing.
        addEventListener("beforeunload", (event) => {
          if (["connected", "writing"].includes(card.dataset.phase)) event.preventDefault();
        });
        if (!("serial" in navigator)) {
          el("hint").textContent = "这个浏览器不能连接设备。请用电脑版 Chrome 或 Edge 打开本页。";
          el("connect").disabled = true;
        }
      }
  </script>
</Site>
<style is:global>
  /* Introduction and step tracker */
  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px 48px;
    padding: 56px 0 40px;
  }
  .intro > div {
    flex: 1 1 420px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .needs {
    flex: 0 1 380px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-top: 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .needs li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 72px minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  .needs li span:first-child {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .tracker {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 150px), 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--line);
  }
  .tracker li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .tracker span {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .tracker strong {
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .tracker .past {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .tracker .past span::after {
    content: " ✓";
  }
  .tracker [aria-current] {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
  }

  /* Steps */
  .layout {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 40px 56px;
    padding: 48px 0 64px;
  }
  .steps {
    flex: 1 1 520px;
    min-width: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0 18px;
    padding: 26px 0;
  }
  .step + .step {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .number {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .step p {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .checks {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .checks li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  /* Installer */
  .flash {
    margin-top: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .flash-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 12px 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .flash-head .mono {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .flash-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #b9b6ad;
  }
  [data-phase="connected"] .dot,
  [data-phase="done"] .dot {
    background: var(--ink);
  }
  [data-phase="writing"] .dot {
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .flash-body,
  .flash-body > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .flash-body {
    padding: 22px 18px 20px;
  }
  .flash p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .flash p.notice {
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .flash p.keep {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .flash p.finished {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .flash p.after {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .flash dl {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .flash dl div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 88px minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  .flash dt {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .confirm {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .confirm input {
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    accent-color: var(--ink);
  }
  .choices {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .choices .primary {
    flex: 1 1 200px;
  }
  .progress-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .track {
    height: 8px;
    background: #ebe9e2;
  }
  .track div {
    width: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--ink);
    transition: width 0.12s linear;
  }

  /* Card layout and font download */
  .tree {
    margin-top: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: #fbfaf7;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .tree div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tree span:first-child {
    min-width: 150px;
  }
  .tree span + span {
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }
  .tree strong {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .font-note {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px 20px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .step .font-note p {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .font-note a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .font-note a:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  aside {
    flex: 0 1 340px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 28px;
    align-content: start;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  aside > div {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-top: 16px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  aside p {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 12px 0;
  }
  h3 + details {
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  summary {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
</style>
